# Phase 11 checks for the admin Dashboard and Reports (VS Code REST Client: click "Send Request" above a block).
# Start the API first (npm run dev:api) and load the sample data (npm run seed:api). Every request here only
# reads: nothing changes in the database.
#
# Every request needs an admin token: get one with the sign-in requests at the top of catalog.http and
# paste it into @adminToken below. A customer's token gets 403 FORBIDDEN, no token 401 UNAUTHENTICATED.
# Errors come back as { code, message, meta }. The figures come from domain/reports.js (@tm/shared):
# revenue is payments verified in the range less refunds sent in it.

@api = http://localhost:4000/api
@adminToken = paste-an-admin-token
@customerToken = paste-a-customer-token

### The Dashboard: eventsToday (whole records with customerName, packageName and the money figures),
### pending (newest first), pendingOldestDays, unverifiedPayments, revenueThisMonth, upcoming (next 5)
GET {{api}}/admin/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### The Reports page's figures for a range: this_year (also when ?range= is left out), last_12, last_year, all.
### { range, eventsServed, revenue, refunds, averagePerEvent, declineRate, revenueBy, revenueChart, packageCounts }
GET {{api}}/admin/reports?range=this_year
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### "All time": revenueBy "year", one bar per year from the first payment or refund to this year
GET {{api}}/admin/reports?range=all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### A range the page does not offer: 400 INVALID "Unknown report range." (meta.field "range")
GET {{api}}/admin/reports?range=last_week
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Saved report: monthly sales, one row per month (Payments, one column per method, Total, Refunds, Net)
GET {{api}}/admin/reports/saved/monthly_sales?range=last_12
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Saved report: outstanding balances, approved bookings and after that still owe money, by event date
### (the range does not change it)
GET {{api}}/admin/reports/saved/outstanding
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### A saved report that does not exist: 400 INVALID "Unknown report."
GET {{api}}/admin/reports/saved/weekly_sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### A customer's token: 403 FORBIDDEN (every /api/admin address)
GET {{api}}/admin/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### No token: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{api}}/admin/reports?range=all
